<details class="planning-debug-help">
    <summary>Debug workflow generation</summary>
    <p>You can create and review workflows with the normal launch profile. To inspect LLM requests and responses, stop this server and select the <strong>Diagnostic</strong> launch profile in your IDE, or run:</p>
    <pre><code>dotnet run --project src/GnOuGo.Agent.Server --launch-profile Diagnostic</code></pre>
    <p>Use the browser window opened by that profile. It authenticates local operator access. Choose <strong>Diagnostic — thresholds are warnings</strong> when creating a new plan to relax planning targets. Financial limits and execution approval still apply.</p>
</details>
